[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 17523.39, "timestamp": "04:52:03", "text": "比如社交媒体，那不是，但我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17525.788, "timestamp": "04:52:05", "text": "大概是吧，我当时没那么想。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17529.03, "timestamp": "04:52:09", "text": "尝试一下那玩意儿。是的，你是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17532.31, "timestamp": "04:52:12", "text": "你已经分身乏术了，现在"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17535.67, "timestamp": "04:52:15", "text": "“传播自己”是什么意思？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17538.788, "timestamp": "04:52:18", "text": "是的，就像做很多事情一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17541.27, "timestamp": "04:52:21", "text": "好的。而不是做两个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17543.51, "timestamp": "04:52:23", "text": "事情，比如五到六到八件。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17547.83, "timestamp": "04:52:27", "text": "十件事。那可不好。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17549.99, "timestamp": "04:52:29", "text": "想象一下。你在烹饪食物"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17553.35, "timestamp": "04:52:33", "text": "你的地方，你就像你可以……也许"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17557.27, "timestamp": "04:52:37", "text": "就像你可以做烤饼然后看看一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17560.628, "timestamp": "04:52:40", "text": "牛奶。但他并没有只做两个，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17563.03, "timestamp": "04:52:43", "text": "你看起来就像在做烤饼一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17564.39, "timestamp": "04:52:44", "text": "你看着牛奶，然后你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17567.59, "timestamp": "04:52:47", "text": "还会做咖喱。某事可能会倾向于"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17569.67, "timestamp": "04:52:49", "text": "出错。你可能会把牛奶洒出来。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17571.83, "timestamp": "04:52:51", "text": "你可能会把烤饼烤糊，或者你可能会"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 17572.439, "timestamp": "04:52:52", "author": "@BRUCELEE-wt7hk", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_kywKa6HSckNVxhER8qedLRRVkcGIqFFytjQHe-071HyMo=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "hello joqnix"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17576.07, "timestamp": "04:52:56", "text": "比如在这个过程中把咖喱烧焦了。啊，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17579.83, "timestamp": "04:52:59", "text": "所以这就是传播它的意义所在。"}]